Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 18:55:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): request live classic skin changes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Selecting a classic skin or cape in the Dressing Room now requests a PlayerSkin update while connected to a Bedrock world and refreshes the local renderer. Use the local actor UUID from Bedrock’s player list for the wire packet; the Java profile UUID is synthesized and may differ. Keep the next-join appearance as fallback when a live request cannot be attempted, and describe submission as a request because the packet path has no acceptance acknowledgement.
